[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0394","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0394.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0471","title":"Sun Solaris ufsrestore 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"通过 ufsrestore 命令的缓冲区溢出漏洞影响原始的 Solaris 系列操作系统。由于 ufsrestore 程序对用户输入的路径参数处理存在缺陷，导致其分配的缓冲区大小不足以容纳过长的路径字符串。当攻击者向系统提供超过缓冲区容量的路径名时，程序会发生缓冲区溢出，允许攻击者执行注入的shell代码。根据 CVSS 向量评分（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），该漏洞允许身份验证或授权的本地攻击者完全控制操作系统权限（可读、可写、可执行），并可能永久破坏系统可用性。该漏洞主要影响 Solaris 2.5、2.6、7.0 和 8 版本，在上述操作系统上执行 ufsrestore 命令的本地用户或进程均可触发此漏洞。攻击者通过向 ufsrestore 命令传递超长路径名，即可绕过对输入长度的常规限制，从而劫持程序控制权，最终达到获取权限的攻击目的。仅要求本地访问权限，且利用方式相对简单，但风险极高，可能导致系统被完全控制，数据泄露或破坏。该漏洞最早出现在 2000 年 6 月 14 日，至今已有十余年历史，但针对此漏洞的补丁相对较晚，许多旧版 Solaris 系统可能仍然受到影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0471"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-14T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:48Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun Microsystems 发布的官方安全补丁：Solaris 8 安装补丁 108993-01 或更高版本，Solaris 7 安装 107544-01 或更高版本，Solaris 2.6 安装 106089-01 或更高版本，Solaris 2.5.1 安装 103642-01 或更高版本。可通过 SunSolve (sunsolve.sun.com) 下载对应补丁包并使用 patchadd 命令安装。如无法立即打补丁，建议暂时移除 ufsrestore 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/lib/fs/ufs/ufsrestore）作为临时缓解措施，并限制本地用户对 ufsrestore 命令的执行权限。建议尽快升级至 Solaris 9 或更高版本彻底修复该漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0114.html","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/210","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/36866","http://www.osvdb.org/1398","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1348","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4711","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20014","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0471.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0471","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0471.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0471.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vw5f-6vw7-vhhj/GHSA-vw5f-6vw7-vhhj.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2000-0471.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0471.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0394.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0394.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0394.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0658","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0658.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0565","title":"SmartFTP SmartFTP Daemon 0.2 目录遍历漏洞","description":"SmartFTP Daemon 0.2 存在目录遍历访问控制漏洞。本地攻击者可通过上传特制的用户配置文件，并在文件名中使用 `..`（点点）路径遍历攻击，绕过文件访问限制，从而访问或读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞仅影响 SmartFTP Daemon 0.2 版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用难度较低，但危害仅限于敏感信息泄露，无法实现代码执行或权限提升。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0565"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00Z","remediation":"SmartFTP Daemon 0.2 已停止维护多年，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即卸载 SmartFTP Daemon 0.2，升级至受支持的 FTP 服务器软件（如 vsftpd、ProFTPD 或 FileZilla Server 最新版）。如无法立即替换，可在服务器本地限制 SmartFTP Daemon 进程的文件系统访问权限，禁止非授权用户上传配置文件，并监控 .. 路径穿越攻击行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0100.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1394","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1344","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4706","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0565.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0565","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c144cc7f0a439e059cbec31e55f668a8db4215cb/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0565.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0565.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ffjf-v6q2-h2mv/GHSA-ffjf-v6q2-h2mv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0565.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0565.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0658.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0623","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0623.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0542","title":"Tigris 远程访问服务器登录认证绕过漏洞","description":"Tigris 远程访问服务器 11.5.4.22 之前版本存在 Radius 计费信息记录缺陷，当用户首次登录认证失败后再次成功登录时，系统未能正确记录 Radius 计费日志，导致安全审计信息不完整。远程攻击者可利用此漏洞绕过登录审计追踪，掩盖未授权访问行为，影响系统的可追溯性和合规性。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.0，攻击复杂度低，无需认证即可远程利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0542"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-13T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:57Z","remediation":"升级 Tigris 远程访问服务器至 11.5.4.22 或更高版本。该版本修复了用户首次登录认证失败后再次成功登录时 Radius 计费信息记录不完整的问题。如无法立即升级，可在 Radius 服务器端启用详细日志审计，监控异常认证行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0104.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1345","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4705","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0542.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0542","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0542.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0542.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hhv3-85xh-f65h/GHSA-hhv3-85xh-f65h.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0542.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0542.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/jmohitz/SECAI/blob/33119e592f944e313664a5f75ae76284ea4b3fe8/data/CWE/223.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0623.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0613","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0613.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0535","title":"FreeBSD Alpha端口 OpenSSL 与 OpenSSH 弱密钥生成漏洞","description":"FreeBSD Alpha 平台上缺少 /dev/random 和 /dev/urandom 随机数设备，而 OpenSSL 0.9.4 及 OpenSSH 在初始化时未正确检查这些设备是否存在，导致系统回退到弱随机数生成器产生可预测的加密密钥。攻击者可通过分析密钥空间实施暴力破解，从而解密通信内容或伪造身份认证。该漏洞影响运行于 FreeBSD Alpha 架构的系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0535"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:56Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.5 及以上版本，升级 OpenSSH 至 2.1 及以上版本，确保代码在 `/dev/random` 不存在时能回退到 EGD（Entropy Gathering Daemon）或其他熵源。在 FreeBSD Alpha 系统上手动创建 `/dev/random` 和 `/dev/urandom` 设备节点（`mknod /dev/random c 1 8`、`mknod /dev/urandom c 1 9`），或加载内核随机数生成器模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-06/0083.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1340","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2000/CVE-2000-0535.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0535.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0535","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0535.json","https://github.com/entrysky/mageni/blob/c58dcc9bc43b7fb267bb10a8083ada356fbc81d1/plugins/2020/openssl/gb_openssl_CVE-2000-0535.nasl","https://github.com/secure-software-engineering/achilles-benchmark-depscanners/blob/78b391f47cbe64adf7a2e2182ff94be604eb94dd/detection/CVE-2000-0535__org.jruby_openssl_0.9.4.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7h84-xvh7-f4r4/GHSA-7h84-xvh7-f4r4.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0535.md","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0xxx/cve-2000-0535.yaml","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/1959df386fdebd740db724e4a35bc2cfa0cd1598/openvas-feeds/vt-feed/nasl/2020/openssl/gb_openssl_CVE-2000-0535.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0613.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0613.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0491","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0491.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0639","title":"Sean MacGuire Big Brother CGI 文件上传远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Big Brother 监控系统 1.4h2 及更早版本的默认配置中缺少适当的访问控制限制，导致远程攻击者可通过 bbd 组件上传具有可执行扩展名的文件，该文件随后会被 Web 服务器作为 CGI 脚本执行，从而实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Big Brother 1.0/1.3/1.4 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，获取系统控制权。官方已发布更新修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0639"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:09Z","remediation":"升级 Big Brother 至 1.5 及以上版本（该版本修复了 bbd 默认无访问限制的问题）；如无法升级，在 Web 服务器配置中禁止执行 /bb/logs/ 目录下的 CGI/PHP 脚本（如 Apache 中移除该目录的 ExecCGI 权限），并在防火墙层面限制对 bbd 服务端口（默认 1984/TCP）的访问，仅允许受信 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0171.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1472","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1494","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5103","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20092","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0639.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0639","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0639.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603a