可向目标 KDC 服务器发送特制请求，触发内存重复释放操作，导致程序崩溃或服务不可用，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Kerberos 4.0、Kerberos 5 1.0、5 1.1.1 及 5-1.1 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至已修复版本或应用厂商提供的补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0550"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58Z","remediation":"升级 MIT Kerberos 至 krb5-1.2 及以上版本，或为 krb5-1.0.x/krb5-1.1.x 应用 MIT 官方补丁（krb4kdc_10x_patch.txt / krb4kdc_111_patch.txt），补丁下载地址 https://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/index.html。KTH-krb4 用户升级至 0.10 及以上版本。Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000-031 提供的更新包。如无法立即升级，可在 KDC 上禁用 Kerberos 4 兼容模式作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0064.html","http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/k-051.shtml","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/krb4kdc.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-11.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-031.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1465","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0550.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0550","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0550.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0550.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2j8h-wx6g-vcxm/GHSA-2j8h-wx6g-vcxm.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0550.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability