ess_v4 函数在处理 localrealm 变量时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 KDC 服务发送特制的请求触发该漏洞，导致目标系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 Kerberos 4 协议认证的系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。建议升级至已修复版本或禁用 Kerberos 4 协议支持。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0547"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:58Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 MIT Kerberos 至 krb5-1.2 及以上版本，或应用 MIT 官方发布的 krb5-1.0.x/krb5-1.1.1 补丁（参见 http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/krb4kdc.txt）。对于 KTH-krb4 用户，升级至 0.10 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络层面限制对 KDC 端口（TCP/UDP 88）的访问，仅允许可信客户端连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0064.html","http://ciac.llnl.gov/ciac/bulletins/k-051.shtml","http://web.mit.edu/kerberos/www/advisories/krb4kdc.txt","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-11.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1338","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0547.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0547","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0547.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0547.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x78p-3cmg-8mqw/GHSA-x78p-3cmg-8mqw.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0547.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/rootio-avr/public-patches-catalog/blob/07753db698538933