,"updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用服务器上的 mailview.cgi 脚本，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 `<Location>` 指令）限制对该脚本的访问。在无法删除的情况下，在 CGI 脚本入口处对 `..` 路径遍历字符进行严格过滤，拒绝包含 `../` 或 `..\\` 的请求。建议迁移至仍在维护的邮件服务软件，如 Roundcube 或 SquirrelMail 的后续安全版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0081.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1335","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20008","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0526.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0526","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/11a92cc3c0d31b9e78fe8f2a857dd04df3195701/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0526.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0526.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/724a585dd64bbf0d8e6760dd16b808140e9a0dd8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-79hc-q675-w3mx/GHSA-79hc-q675-w3mx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0526.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0526.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0437.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0437.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0437.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0423","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0423.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0506","title":"Linux 内核 Capabilities 权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.2.16 之前版本中的 \"capabilities\"（能力）机制存在权限提升漏洞。本地攻击者可通过设置 capabilities（使用 setcap 等机制）阻止 setuid 程序正常降权，导致拒绝服务或获取提升后的特权，即 \"Linux kernel setuid/setcap vulnerability\"。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.2.x 系列、2.4.0-test1 及 SGI ProPack 1.2/1.3 等发行版，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重），向量 AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C，攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、完全影响机密性/完整性/可用性。本地攻击者利用该漏洞可绕过 setuid 程序的权限降低机制，实现权限提升或拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0506"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-09T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.16 或更高版本（2.2.x 分支）或升级至 2.4.x 稳定版本。SGI ProPack 用户请升级至 1.4 或更高版本（内核 ≥ 2.2.16）。若无法立即升级内核，可作为临时缓解措施：1) 移除不需要的 setuid 程序；2) 使用 chmod 移除不必要的 setuid 位；3) 限制本地用户登录权限；4) 监控异常 setuid 进程行为。Sendmail 用户请升级至 8.11 以上版本并禁用不必要的 capabilities 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0062.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0063.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-037.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1322","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=Pine.LNX.4.21.0006090852340.3475-300000%40alfa.elzabsoft.pl","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20000","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0506.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0506","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0506.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/3bd1bd6e15d7a361230990a418fdbc924d1d9ca2/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2000-0506.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0506.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-hp2c-p3rm-92wr/GHSA-hp2c-p3rm-92wr.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0506.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_400_500.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-267.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0423.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0423.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0423.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1198","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0525","title":"OpenSSH UseLogin 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"OpenSSH 在启用 UseLogin 选项时未能正确丢弃权限，导致本地用户可通过向 ssh 守护进程提供恶意命令来执行任意代码。该漏洞影响启用 UseLogin 配置的 OpenSSH 版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低。成功利用后攻击者可获得目标系统的完全控制权限，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0525"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-08T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55Z","remediation":"立即在 /etc/sshd_config 中将 UseLogin 设置为 no（UseLogin no），然后重启 sshd 服务。如必须使用 UseLogin 功能，请升级至 OpenSSH 2.1.1 或更高版本。OpenBSD 用户可参考官方 errata 006 获取补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0065.html","http://www.openbsd.org/errata.html#uselogin","http://www.osvdb.org/341","http://ww